# Stormbeacon Blade: "Whenever equipped creature attacks, draw a card if you control three or more attacking creatures" - one
# trigger for the one equipped creature, so four attackers draw a single card, not one per attacker. "+3/+0" changes power only:
# the equipped Ornithopter is a 3/2 and Bot2 takes 3 from it (20 to 17). The three attackers beside it are 0/2.
# Equip {2} is paid with the Lotus's leftover mana; the Blade itself with the Pearl's {W} and one more.

